"block\"><mtable displaystyle=\"true\" columnalign=\"right left\" columnspacing=\"0em\" rowspacing=\"0.8em 0.8em 0.3em\"><mtr><mtd><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>12</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>35</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>≈</mo><mn>12</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>12</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace></mstyle><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle mathcolor=\"green\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>✓</mi></mrow></mstyle></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>8</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>12</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>8</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>28</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>≈</mo><mn>9</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Therefore, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"165\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c36\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is the global maximum of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"166\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D443 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> So, the company must open <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"167\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c36\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> restaurants to maximize its profit.</p>\n</div></div>",
