/mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>0.3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>10</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mn>000</mn><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace></mstyle><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle mathcolor=\"green\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>✓</mi></mrow></mstyle></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>13</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>13</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>0.3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>13</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>219.7</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Therefore, we conclude that the maximum profit is <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"429\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c24\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.167em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">$</mi><mn>1</mn><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mn>000.</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</div></div>",
